ooo|ouroboros,interview,seed,run workflow,evaluate,evolve,ooo ralph,specification first,socratic interview,git-aware interview,ambiguity reduction,execution plan,cli harness execute,persistent completion|Ouroboros spec-first loop: git-grounded interview→seed→plan(spec-kit)→execute(cli-anything)→evaluate→evolve. Interview Context scored against .ouroboros/interview-context.md regenerated from live git data (scripts/git-interview-context.sh); frozen seed rendered to execution plan via /speckit.plan→/speckit.tasks (seed→plan one-way; spec-first authoring belongs to spec-kit); run stage executes through CLI-Hub harnesses (cli-hub search→install→launch, --json output = evaluate evidence, name harnesses in seed constraints). Install: bash scripts/install.sh (knobs OOO_GIT_INTERVIEW, OOO_SPEC_KIT, OOO_CLI_ANYTHING, SPEC_KIT_REF, CLI_ANYTHING_HUB_SPEC). Plugin: claude plugin marketplace add Q00/ouroboros. pip: ouroboros-ai[all]. Commands: ouroboros init start, ouroboros run workflow, ouroboros status, ouroboros tui monitor, ouroboros cancel, ouroboros mcp serve.|Q00/ouroboros|MIT|0.29.0
